| host1 | eth0   | 1970-01-01T00:00:05 | 10.0                                  |
| host1 | eth0   | 1970-01-01T00:00:05 | 5.0                                   |
| host1 | eth1   | 1970-01-01T00:00:00 | 10.0                                  |
| host1 | eth1   | 1970-01-01T00:00:00 | 5.0                                   |
| host1 | eth1   | 1970-01-01T00:00:05 | 10.0                                  |
| host1 | eth1   | 1970-01-01T00:00:05 | 5.0                                   |
+-------+--------+---------------------+---------------------------------------+

